<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-130-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.503766" lon="-121.080533"><name>SC26-130-B</name><cmt>SC26-130</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 12.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 68/100; not catch probability. Center 116 ft; nearby 97–155 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 507 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-103</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.50377621964811" lon="-121.08400526994384"/><trkpt lat="35.503325637951306" lon="-121.08401597519557"/><trkpt lat="35.50268256604372" lon="-121.08325953559415"/><trkpt lat="35.502322100781214" lon="-121.08326810280127"/><trkpt lat="35.502235487041446" lon="-121.08349065088923"/><trkpt lat="35.501334323652436" lon="-121.08351206568737"/><trkpt lat="35.501509302460775" lon="-121.08317717630409"/><trkpt lat="35.50076734778594" lon="-121.08187189722146"/><trkpt lat="35.50103243826317" lon="-121.08153486329273"/><trkpt lat="35.50102717903754" lon="-121.08120425915091"/><trkpt lat="35.50075332372571" lon="-121.08099028908937"/><trkpt lat="35.500742801456205" lon="-121.08032908339003"/><trkpt lat="35.50128174445289" lon="-121.0802060119197"/><trkpt lat="35.50135957907872" lon="-121.0794324546